  triage:description "AX.4 QA-1 (quality-mgr ax4-qa-r1, PR #1194 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T09:14Z; found by req-qa, confirmed by quality-mgr) at head aaf2e04bf. The sprint doc docs/plans/phase-ax/sprint-AX.4-task-cli-and-docs.md Required validation names a concrete artifact: a crates/atm/tests integration test covering AC1 (list surfaces after AX.3's AC1 scenario) and AC2 (atm send --task-complete success, unknown-id and exit-code paths) end to end on a rusqlite runtime. No such file exists at HEAD: crates/atm/tests holds only cli_surface.rs, compose_passthrough.rs, openapi_surface.rs, peer_cli.rs and cli_surface_baseline.json, none touching tasks. All task coverage in the diff is unit-level. Fix: add the named integration test exercising AC1 and AC2 against a real rusqlite-backed runtime." ;
